msgid "Our plugins"
msgstr "Plugin kami"

msgid "Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Plugin Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Generous, privacy-first WordPress plugins — built in Denmark. Free cores, no"
" credits, your data stays on your site."
msgstr ""
"Plugin WordPress yang dermawan dan mengutamakan privasi — dibuat di Denmark."
" Inti gratis, tanpa kredit, data Anda tetap di situs Anda."

msgid "More from Lynbro"
msgstr "Lainnya dari Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Our growing suite of free, privacy-first plugins. Already-installed ones are"
" marked."
msgstr ""
"Kumpulan plugin gratis kami yang terus bertambah, mengutamakan privasi. "
"Plugin yang sudah terpasang ditandai."

msgid "Installed"
msgstr "Terpasang"

msgid "On WordPress.org"
msgstr "Di WordPress.org"

msgid "Coming soon"
msgstr "Segera hadir"

msgid "Install"
msgstr "Pasang"

msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Pelajari lebih lanjut"

msgid "About Lynbro"
msgstr "Tentang Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Lynbro builds genuinely free, privacy-first WordPress plugins with generous "
"free cores — no credits, no paywalls on the essentials, your data on your "
"own site. Made in Denmark."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro membuat plugin WordPress yang benar-benar gratis dan mengutamakan "
"privasi dengan inti gratis yang dermawan — tanpa kredit, tanpa paywall untuk"
" fitur penting, data Anda tetap di situs Anda sendiri. Dibuat di Denmark."

msgid "Visit Lynbro"
msgstr "Kunjungi Lynbro"

msgid "Suggest a feature or report a bug"
msgstr "Usulkan fitur atau laporkan bug"

msgid ""
"Feedback opens our public roadmap on plugins.lynbro.dk in a new tab — "
"nothing is sent from your site."
msgstr ""
"Masukan akan membuka peta jalan publik kami di plugins.lynbro.dk di tab baru"
" — tidak ada yang dikirim dari situs Anda."

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Alat"

msgid ""
"Export this plugin&#8217;s settings as a JSON backup, or reset them to "
"defaults. 100% local — nothing leaves your site."
msgstr ""
"Ekspor pengaturan plugin ini sebagai cadangan JSON, atau atur ulang ke "
"default. 100% lokal — tidak ada yang keluar dari situs Anda."

msgid "Export settings (JSON)"
msgstr "Ekspor pengaturan (JSON)"

msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "Atur ulang ke default"

msgid "About Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Tentang Lynbro SMTP"

msgid ""
"WordPress sends email with PHP mail() by default, which inboxes treat as "
"suspicious. Lynbro SMTP sends it through a real, authenticated mail server "
"instead — the one of your host, your mailbox or a sending service — so "
"password resets, orders and contact forms arrive."
msgstr ""
"WordPress mengirim email dengan PHP mail() secara bawaan, yang dianggap "
"mencurigakan oleh kotak masuk. Lynbro SMTP mengirimnya melalui server email "
"asli yang terautentikasi — milik host Anda, kotak surat Anda, atau layanan "
"pengiriman — sehingga reset kata sandi, pesanan, dan formulir kontak tiba."

msgid ""
"Everything is in the free plugin: the log, resend, the backup connection, "
"alerts, diagnostics and WP-CLI. There is no paid version."
msgstr ""
"Semua fitur ada di plugin gratis: log, kirim ulang, koneksi cadangan, "
"peringatan, diagnostik, dan WP-CLI. Tidak ada versi berbayar."

msgid "How your data is handled"
msgstr "Bagaimana data Anda diproses"

msgid ""
"Email goes straight from your server to the SMTP server you set. The plugin "
"contacts no Lynbro service and sends no statistics anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Email dikirim langsung dari server Anda ke server SMTP yang Anda atur. "
"Plugin ini tidak terhubung ke layanan Lynbro dan tidak mengirim statistik ke"
" mana pun."

msgid ""
"The SMTP password is encrypted with your site's security keys, never shown "
"again and never written to the log or the settings export."
msgstr ""
"Kata sandi SMTP dienkripsi dengan kunci keamanan situs Anda, tidak pernah "
"ditampilkan lagi, dan tidak pernah ditulis ke log atau ekspor pengaturan."

msgid ""
"The log keeps recipients, subject and status in your own database. Message "
"content only for failed emails by default, and every entry is deleted after "
"the retention period."
msgstr ""
"Log menyimpan penerima, subjek, dan status di database Anda sendiri. Isi "
"pesan hanya untuk email yang gagal secara default, dan setiap entri dihapus "
"setelah masa retensi."

msgid ""
"Log entries are included in Tools → Export Personal Data and Erase Personal "
"Data."
msgstr ""
"Entri log disertakan dalam Tools → Ekspor Data Pribadi dan Hapus Data "
"Pribadi."

msgid ""
"A failure webhook, if you set one, receives only the error text and a link "
"to your log."
msgstr ""
"Webhook kegagalan, jika Anda mengaturnya, hanya menerima teks error dan "
"tautan ke log Anda."

msgid "Keep the login in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Simpan login di wp-config.php"

msgid ""
"Any of these constants overrides the field in Settings, and the value never "
"reaches the database or its backups:"
msgstr ""
"Salah satu konstanta ini akan menimpa kolom di Pengaturan, dan nilainya "
"tidak pernah masuk ke database atau cadangannya:"

msgid "WP-CLI"
msgstr "WP-CLI"

msgid "Version & links"
msgstr "Versi & tautan"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versi"

msgid "Plugin home page"
msgstr "Beranda plugin"

msgid "Lynbro"
msgstr "Lynbro"

msgid "Send a test email"
msgstr "Kirim email percobaan"

msgid ""
"No SMTP server is set yet, so the test goes out with PHP mail(). Fill in "
"Settings first to test SMTP."
msgstr ""
"Belum ada server SMTP yang diatur, jadi percobaan akan dikirim dengan PHP "
"mail(). Isi Pengaturan terlebih dahulu untuk menguji SMTP."

msgid "Recipient"
msgstr "Penerima"

msgid "Test the backup connection"
msgstr "Uji koneksi cadangan"

msgid "SMTP conversation (password hidden)"
msgstr "Percakapan SMTP (kata sandi disembunyikan)"

msgid ""
"Test emails ignore test mode and \"do not send\" mode, so you can check the "
"connection on a staging copy."
msgstr ""
"Email percobaan mengabaikan mode percobaan dan mode \"jangan kirim\", "
"sehingga Anda dapat memeriksa koneksi pada salinan staging."

msgid "Can this server reach the SMTP server?"
msgstr "Apakah server ini dapat terhubung ke server SMTP?"

msgid ""
"Many hosts block outgoing mail ports. This checks the usual ones to your "
"saved host, from this web server."
msgstr ""
"Banyak host memblokir port email keluar. Ini memeriksa port yang umum ke "
"host yang Anda simpan, dari server web ini."

msgid "Check ports"
msgstr "Periksa port"

msgid "Sender domain: %s"
msgstr "Domain pengirim: %s"

msgid "DNS lookups are not available on this server."
msgstr "Pencarian DNS tidak tersedia di server ini."

msgid ""
"Make sure it includes your SMTP provider (for example "
"include:spf.brevo.com)."
msgstr ""
"Pastikan mencakup penyedia SMTP Anda (misalnya include:spf.brevo.com)."

msgid ""
"No SPF record. Add one at your DNS host that names your SMTP provider, or "
"many inboxes will distrust the email."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada record SPF. Tambahkan di penyedia DNS Anda yang menyebut penyedia "
"SMTP Anda, atau banyak kotak masuk akan meragukan email tersebut."

msgid ""
"No DMARC record. Gmail and Yahoo require one for bulk senders; even a simple"
" \"v=DMARC1; p=none\" helps."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada record DMARC. Gmail dan Yahoo mewajibkannya untuk pengirim massal;"
" bahkan \"v=DMARC1; p=none\" sederhana sudah membantu."

msgid ""
"DKIM is set up at your SMTP provider (they give you the DNS record). It "
"cannot be checked from here without the selector name."
msgstr ""
"DKIM diatur di penyedia SMTP Anda (mereka memberikan record DNS-nya). Ini "
"tidak dapat diperiksa dari sini tanpa nama selector."

