msgstr "Hapus yang dipilih"

msgid "%1$s entries · deleted automatically after %2$s days"
msgstr "%1$s entri · dihapus otomatis setelah %2$s hari"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "Memeriksa…"

msgid "Sent. Check the inbox (and the spam folder) of the recipient."
msgstr "Terkirim. Periksa kotak masuk (dan folder spam) penerima."

msgid "Not sent."
msgstr "Tidak terkirim."

msgid "open"
msgstr "buka"

msgid "blocked"
msgstr "diblokir"

msgid "Request failed:"
msgstr "Permintaan gagal:"

msgid "Delivered through:"
msgstr "Dikirim melalui:"

msgid "You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin yang cukup untuk mengakses halaman ini."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

msgid "Test & diagnostics"
msgstr "Uji & diagnostik"

msgid "Email log"
msgstr "Log email"

msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "Masukan"

msgid "About"
msgstr "Tentang"

msgid ""
"Send every WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log,"
" resend, a backup connection and failure alerts. All free, no upsells."
msgstr ""
"Kirim semua email WordPress melalui server SMTP Anda sendiri — dengan log "
"email, kirim ulang, koneksi cadangan, dan peringatan kegagalan. Semua "
"gratis, tanpa upsell."

msgid "The email was sent again."
msgstr "Email telah dikirim ulang."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again — see the newest log entry for the reason."
msgstr ""
"Email tidak dapat dikirim ulang — lihat entri log terbaru untuk alasannya."

msgid "The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent."
msgstr "Konten email ini tidak disimpan, jadi tidak dapat dikirim ulang."

msgid "Log entries deleted."
msgstr "Entri log dihapus."

msgid ""
"Settings imported. Enter the SMTP password once and save — passwords are "
"never copied from other plugins."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan diimpor. Masukkan kata sandi SMTP sekali dan simpan — kata sandi "
"tidak pernah disalin dari plugin lain."

msgid "Set in wp-config.php"
msgstr "Diatur di wp-config.php"

msgid "Email is sent through %1$s on port %2$s."
msgstr "Email dikirim melalui %1$s pada port %2$s."

msgid ""
"No SMTP server set yet — WordPress still sends with PHP mail(). Pick your "
"provider below, fill in the login and save."
msgstr ""
"Belum ada server SMTP yang diatur — WordPress masih mengirim dengan PHP "
"mail(). Pilih penyedia Anda di bawah, isi login, lalu simpan."

msgid "Delivery is switched off: emails are logged but not sent."
msgstr "Pengiriman dimatikan: email dicatat tetapi tidak dikirim."

msgid "Test mode: every email goes to %s instead of its recipients."
msgstr "Mode uji: setiap email dikirim ke %s вместо ke penerimanya."

msgid ""
"The saved password can no longer be read because the site's security keys "
"changed. Enter it again and save."
msgstr ""
"Kata sandi yang disimpan აღარ dapat dibaca karena kunci keamanan situs "
"berubah. Masukkan lagi lalu simpan."

msgid "Last failure %1$s ago: %2$s"
msgstr "Kegagalan terakhir %1$s yang lalu: %2$s"

msgid "Show failed emails"
msgstr "Tampilkan email yang gagal"

msgid ""
"Also active: %s. Two mail plugins fight over the same email — deactivate the"
" other one."
msgstr ""
"Juga aktif: %s. Dua plugin email saling berebut email yang sama — "
"nonaktifkan yang lain."

msgid "Import settings from %s"
msgstr "Impor pengaturan dari %s"

msgid "SMTP server"
msgstr "Server SMTP"

msgid "Provider"
msgstr "Penyedia"

msgid "Port and encryption"
msgstr "Port dan enkripsi"

msgid "TLS (STARTTLS) — usually port 587"
msgstr "TLS (STARTTLS) — biasanya port 587"

msgid "SSL — usually port 465"
msgstr "SSL — biasanya port 465"

msgid "None — only for a server on the same network"
msgstr "Tidak ada — hanya untuk server di jaringan yang sama"

msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Autentikasi"

msgid "The server needs a username and password (almost always)"
msgstr "Server memerlukan nama pengguna dan kata sandi (hampir selalu)"

msgid ""
"The password comes from LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS in wp-config.php and is not stored "
"in the database."
msgstr ""
"Kata sandi diambil dari LYNBRO_SMTP_PASS di wp-config.php dan tidak disimpan"
" di basis data."

msgid "Saved — leave empty to keep it"
msgstr "Tersimpan — biarkan kosong untuk mempertahankan"

msgid "Remove the saved password"
msgstr "Hapus kata sandi yang disimpan"

msgid ""
"Stored encrypted with your site's security keys and never shown again. To "
"keep it out of the database entirely, define it in wp-config.php (see "
"About)."
msgstr ""
"Disimpan terenkripsi dengan kunci keamanan situs Anda dan tidak akan "
"ditampilkan lagi. Untuk tidak menyimpannya di basis data sama sekali, "
"definisikan di wp-config.php (lihat Tentang)."

msgid "Certificate"
msgstr "Sertifikat"

msgid "Verify the server certificate"
msgstr "Verifikasi sertifikat server"

msgid "Default"
msgstr "Bawaan"

msgid "Untick only for your own server with a self-signed certificate."
msgstr ""
"Hapus centang hanya untuk server Anda sendiri dengan sertifikat self-signed."

msgid "Sender"
msgstr "Pengirim"

msgid "Force this address on every email, whatever other plugins set"
msgstr "Paksa alamat ini pada setiap email, apa pun yang diatur plugin lain"

msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Disarankan"

msgid ""
"Use an address on a domain your SMTP account may send for, or providers "
"reject or spam-folder the email."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan alamat pada domain yang boleh digunakan untuk akun SMTP Anda, atau "
"penyedia akan menolak email atau mengirimnya ke spam."

msgid "Force this name too (off: forms and shops keep their own sender name)"
msgstr ""
"Paksa nama ini juga (nonaktif: formulir dan toko mempertahankan nama "
"pengirimnya sendiri)"

msgid "Default Reply-To"
msgstr "Default Reply-To"

msgid ""
"Used only when an email has no Reply-To of its own, so contact-form replies "
"still go to the visitor."
msgstr ""
"Hanya digunakan saat email tidak memiliki Reply-To sendiri, sehingga balasan"
" formulir kontak tetap dikirim ke pengunjung."

msgid "Return-Path"
msgstr "Return-Path"

msgid "Send bounces to the From address"
msgstr "Kirim bounce ke alamat From"

msgid "Backup connection"
msgstr "Koneksi cadangan"

msgid ""
"When the main server fails, the same email is sent again through the backup "
"at once — the visitor never sees an error."
msgstr ""
"Saat server utama gagal, email yang sama langsung dikirim lagi melalui "
"cadangan — pengunjung tidak akan melihat kesalahan."

msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Cadangan"

msgid "Use a backup when the main server fails"
msgstr "Gunakan cadangan saat server utama gagal"

msgid "Another SMTP server"
msgstr "Server SMTP lain"

msgid "PHP mail() of this server (better than nothing; may land in spam)"
msgstr ""
"PHP mail() server ini (lebih baik daripada tidak ada; mungkin masuk spam)"

msgid "Backup host"
msgstr "Host cadangan"

msgid "Backup port"
msgstr "Port cadangan"

msgid "Backup encryption"
msgstr "Enkripsi cadangan"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

msgid "Backup login"
msgstr "Login cadangan"

msgid "Backup password"
msgstr "Kata sandi cadangan"

msgid "Delivery mode"
msgstr "Mode pengiriman"

msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

msgid "Send normally"
msgstr "Kirim normal"

msgid "Test mode: send everything to one address (Cc and Bcc are dropped)"
msgstr "Mode uji: kirim semua ke satu alamat (Cc dan Bcc dihapus)"

msgid "Redirect address"
msgstr "Alamat pengalihan"

msgid "Do not send any email (staging copies) — emails are still logged"
msgstr "Jangan kirim email apa pun (salinan staging) — email tetap dicatat"

msgid "Log"
msgstr "Log"

msgid "Keep a log of every email (recipient, subject, status, error)"
msgstr "Simpan log setiap email (penerima, subjek, status, kesalahan)"

msgid "Keep message content"
msgstr "Simpan isi pesan"

msgid "Only of failed emails, so they can be resent"
msgstr "Hanya untuk email yang gagal, agar dapat dikirim ulang"

msgid ""
"Of every email (lets you resend anything; the log then holds password-reset "
"links and order details)"
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap email (memungkinkan Anda mengirim ulang apa pun; log kemudian "
"menyimpan tautan pengaturan ulang kata sandi dan detail pesanan)"

msgid "Never"
msgstr "Tidak pernah"

msgid "Keep entries for"
msgstr "Simpan entri selama"

msgid "days, then they are deleted automatically"
msgstr "hari, lalu dihapus otomatis"

msgid "Failure alerts"
msgstr "Peringatan kegagalan"

msgid ""
"At most one alert per hour. The alert email is sent with PHP mail() of this "
"server, because the SMTP server may be the thing that is down."
msgstr ""
"Paling banyak satu peringatan per jam. Email peringatan dikirim dengan PHP "
"mail() server ini, karena server SMTP bisa saja yang sedang bermasalah."

msgid "Alert email"
msgstr "Email peringatan"

msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "URL webhook"

msgid ""
"Optional. Slack, Discord, Microsoft Teams workflows, ntfy or your own "
"endpoint (HTTPS). The plugin posts the error text there — nothing else, and "
"only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Opsional. Workflow Slack, Discord, Microsoft Teams, ntfy, atau endpoint Anda"
" sendiri (HTTPS). Plugin mengirim teks kesalahan ke sana — tidak ada yang "
"lain, dan hanya saat Anda menetapkan URL."

msgid "Import from another SMTP plugin"
msgstr "Impor dari plugin SMTP lain"

msgid ""
"Copies host, port, encryption, username and sender. Passwords stay where "
"they are — enter yours once after importing."
msgstr ""
"Menyalin host, port, enkripsi, nama pengguna, dan pengirim. Kata sandi tetap"
" di tempatnya — masukkan milik Anda sekali setelah impor."

msgid "Import from %s"
msgstr "Impor dari %s"

msgid ""
"No settings of WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP or Post SMTP were "
"found on this site."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ditemukan pengaturan WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP, atau Post"
" SMTP di situs ini."

msgid "Download the log (CSV)"
msgstr "Unduh log (CSV)"

msgid "Delete every log entry?"
msgstr "Hapus setiap entri log?"

msgid "Empty the log"
msgstr "Kosongkan log"

msgid "Is it working for you?"
msgstr "Apakah ini bekerja untuk Anda?"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is free, with nothing locked. If it got your email delivered, a "
"short review helps other people find it."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP gratis, tanpa fitur yang dikunci. Jika berhasil mengirim email "
"Anda, ulasan singkat akan membantu orang lain menemukannya."

msgid "Leave a review on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Tulis ulasan di WordPress.org"

msgid "Something missing or broken?"
msgstr "Ada yang kurang atau rusak?"

msgid ""
"Bug reports and ideas are read by the people who build the plugin. Opening "
"these links sends nothing from your site."
msgstr ""
"Laporan bug dan ide dibaca oleh orang yang membuat plugin ini. Membuka "
"tautan ini tidak mengirim apa pun dari situs Anda."

msgid "Ask in the support forum"
msgstr "Tanyakan di forum dukungan"

msgid "Suggest a feature (public roadmap)"
msgstr "Usulkan fitur (roadmap publik)"

msgid ""
"Posting a log line? Remove addresses first — the Test tab already hides the "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Menulis baris log? Hapus alamat terlebih dahulu — tab Test sudah "
"menyembunyikan kata sandi."

msgid "You do not have permission to do that."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk melakukan itu."

msgid "Enter a valid recipient address."
msgstr "Masukkan alamat penerima yang valid."

msgid ""
"%1$s: the main SMTP connection failed and the backup delivered the email. "
"Error: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"%1$s: koneksi SMTP utama gagal dan cadangan mengirim email. Error: %2$s"

msgid "%1$s: an email could not be sent. Error: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s: email tidak dapat dikirim. Error: %2$s"

msgid "Log entry #%d"
msgstr "Entri log #%d"

msgid "[%s] Email delivery problem"
msgstr "[%s] Masalah pengiriman email"

msgid "Email delivery"
msgstr "Pengiriman email"

msgid "Email is sent through SMTP"
msgstr "Email dikirim melalui SMTP"

msgid "Email"
msgstr "Email"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends this site's email through an authenticated SMTP server."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP mengirim email situs ini melalui server SMTP terautentikasi."

msgid "Open Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Buka Lynbro SMTP"

msgid "Email is sent with PHP mail(), not SMTP"
msgstr "Email dikirim dengan PHP mail(), bukan SMTP"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is active but no SMTP server is set, so email still leaves "
"through PHP mail() and often lands in spam."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP aktif tetapi belum ada server SMTP yang diatur, jadi email masih"
" dikirim melalui PHP mail() dan sering masuk ke spam."

msgid "The saved SMTP password can no longer be read"
msgstr "Kata sandi SMTP yang tersimpan აღარ dapat dibaca"

msgid ""
"The site's security keys changed after the password was saved. Enter the "
"SMTP password again."
msgstr ""
"Kunci keamanan situs berubah setelah kata sandi disimpan. Masukkan kembali "
"kata sandi SMTP."

msgid "Emails failed to send in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "Email gagal dikirim dalam 24 jam terakhir"

msgid "The main SMTP connection failed in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "Koneksi SMTP utama gagal dalam 24 jam terakhir"

msgid "Email delivery (7 days)"
msgstr "Pengiriman email (7 hari)"

msgid "Sent: %1$s · Failed: %2$s"
msgstr "Terkirim: %1$s · Gagal: %2$s"

msgid "No SMTP server is set yet — email is sent with PHP mail()."
msgstr "Belum ada server SMTP yang diatur — email dikirim dengan PHP mail()."

msgid "Show failed"
msgstr "Tampilkan yang gagal"

msgid "Main connection: %1$s — Backup connection: %2$s"
msgstr "Koneksi utama: %1$s — Koneksi cadangan: %2$s"

msgid "Test email from %s"
msgstr "Email percobaan dari %s"

msgid ""
"This is a test email from %1$s, sent by Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"If you can read it, email delivery works.\n"
"\n"
"Sent: %2$s\n"
"Connection: %3$s"
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah email percobaan dari %1$s, dikirim oleh Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"Jika Anda dapat membacanya, pengiriman email berhasil.\n"
"\n"
"Terkirim: %2$s\n"
"Koneksi: %3$s"

msgid "backup"
msgstr "cadangan"

msgid "main"
msgstr "utama"

msgid ""
"The server refused the username or password. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho and iCloud"
" need an app password, not the normal one; SendGrid and Brevo need an "
"SMTP/API key."
msgstr ""
"Server menolak nama pengguna atau kata sandi. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho, dan "
"iCloud memerlukan kata sandi aplikasi, bukan yang biasa; SendGrid dan Brevo "
"memerlukan kunci SMTP/API."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 has SMTP sign-in switched off for this mailbox. An "
"administrator can enable \"Authenticated SMTP\" for it, or use a relay "
"service instead."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 365 mematikan masuk SMTP untuk kotak surat ini. Administrator "
"dapat mengaktifkan \"Authenticated SMTP\" untuknya, atau gunakan layanan "
"relay sebagai gantinya."

msgid ""
"The server could not be reached. Many hosts block outgoing ports 25, 465 and"
" 587 — run the port check below, then ask your host to open the port or use "
"the one that is open."
msgstr ""
"Server tidak dapat dijangkau. Banyak host memblokir port keluar 25, 465, dan"
" 587 — jalankan pemeriksaan port di bawah, lalu minta host Anda membuka port"
" tersebut atau gunakan port yang tersedia."

msgid ""
"The secure connection failed. Check that port and encryption match (587 = "
"TLS, 465 = SSL). If the server uses a self-signed certificate, untick "
"\"Verify the server certificate\"."
msgstr ""
"Koneksi aman gagal. Periksa apakah port dan enkripsi cocok (587 = TLS, 465 ="
" SSL). Jika server menggunakan sertifikat self-signed, hilangkan centang "
"\"Verify the server certificate\"."

msgid ""
"The server does not let this account send as the From address. Use an "
"address on a domain the account owns, and switch on \"Force From email\"."
msgstr ""
"Server tidak mengizinkan akun ini mengirim sebagai alamat From. Gunakan "
"alamat pada domain yang dimiliki akun, dan aktifkan \"Force From email\"."

msgid "The host name does not resolve. Check it for typos."
msgstr "Nama host tidak dapat diresolusikan. Periksa apakah ada salah ketik."

msgid ""
"Read the last SERVER lines of the transcript: the server usually says "
"exactly what it did not like."
msgstr ""
"Baca baris SERVER terakhir dari transkrip: server biasanya mengatakan dengan"
" tepat apa yang tidak disukainya."

msgid "No host set."
msgstr "Tidak ada host yang disetel."

msgid "That log entry no longer exists."
msgstr "Entri log itu აღარ ada."

msgid ""
"The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent. Change "
"\"Keep message content\" in Settings to resend future emails."
msgstr ""
"Konten email ini tidak disimpan, jadi tidak dapat dikirim ulang. Ubah \"Keep"
" message content\" di Pengaturan untuk mengirim ulang email di masa "
"mendatang."

msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again. The new attempt and its error are in the "
"log."
msgstr ""
"Email tidak dapat dikirim lagi. Percobaan baru dan galatnya ada di log."

msgid "Date (UTC)"
msgstr "Tanggal (UTC)"

msgid "Recipients"
msgstr "Penerima"

msgid "Lynbro SMTP email log"
msgstr "Log email SMTP Lynbro"

msgid ""
"The rest of the suite. What is already on this site is marked; nothing "
"installs without you asking for it."
msgstr ""
"Bagian lain dari suite ini. Yang sudah ada di situs ini ditandai; tidak ada "
"yang dipasang tanpa Anda memintanya."

msgid "Active"
msgstr "Aktif"

msgid "Activate"
msgstr "Aktifkan"

msgid "Install now"
msgstr "Pasang sekarang"

msgid "View on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Lihat di WordPress.org"

msgid ""
"Shared Lynbro components v%1$s, provided by %2$s (newest of %3$d versions on"
" this site)."
msgstr ""
"Komponen Lynbro bersama v%1$s, disediakan oleh %2$s (versi terbaru dari %3$d"
" versi di situs ini)."

msgid "Reset all settings to defaults?"
msgstr "Atur ulang semua pengaturan ke default?"

msgid ""
"Is Lynbro SMTP getting your email delivered? A few words on WordPress.org "
"help others find a mail plugin without upsells."
msgstr ""
"Apakah Lynbro SMTP membantu email Anda terkirim? Beberapa kata di "
"WordPress.org membantu orang lain menemukan plugin email tanpa upsell."

msgid "Write a review"
msgstr "Tulis ulasan"

msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Tidak, terima kasih"

msgid ""
"Redirect mode needs an address to redirect to — mail is sent normally until "
"you add one."
msgstr ""
"Mode pengalihan memerlukan alamat tujuan pengalihan — email dikirim secara "
"normal sampai Anda menambahkannya."

msgid "Other SMTP server"
msgstr "Server SMTP lain"

msgid "Use the SMTP details from your host or email provider."
msgstr "Gunakan detail SMTP dari host atau penyedia email Anda."

msgid ""
"Username: your full Gmail address. Password: an app password (Google Account"
" → Security → 2-Step Verification → App passwords), not your normal "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Nama pengguna: alamat Gmail lengkap Anda. Kata sandi: kata sandi aplikasi "
"(Akun Google → Keamanan → Verifikasi 2 Langkah → Sandi aplikasi), bukan kata"
" sandi biasa Anda."

msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 needs \"Authenticated SMTP\" enabled for the mailbox. "
"Microsoft is retiring password sign-in for SMTP; if login fails, use a relay"
" service such as Brevo or your host's SMTP."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 365 memerlukan \"Authenticated SMTP\" diaktifkan untuk kotak surat"
" tersebut. Microsoft menghentikan sign-in kata sandi untuk SMTP; jika login "
"gagal, gunakan layanan relay seperti Brevo atau SMTP dari host Anda."

msgid ""
"Username: the SMTP login shown under SMTP & API. Password: an SMTP key, not "
"your account password."
msgstr ""
"Nama pengguna: login SMTP yang ditampilkan di bawah SMTP & API. Kata sandi: "
"kunci SMTP, bukan kata sandi akun Anda."

msgid "Username: the word \"apikey\". Password: your SendGrid API key."
msgstr "Nama pengguna: kata \"apikey\". Kata sandi: kunci API SendGrid Anda."

msgid ""
"EU accounts use smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Username and password: the SMTP "
"credentials of your sending domain."
msgstr ""
"Akun EU menggunakan smtp.eu.mailgun.org. Nama pengguna dan kata sandi: "
"kredensial SMTP dari domain pengirim Anda."

msgid ""
"Change the region in the host to yours. Username and password: SMTP "
"credentials created in the SES console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Ubah wilayah pada host ke wilayah Anda. Nama pengguna dan kata sandi: "
"kredensial SMTP yang dibuat di konsol SES (bukan kunci akses AWS Anda)."

msgid "Username and password: both are your Server API token."
msgstr "Nama pengguna dan kata sandi: keduanya adalah token Server API Anda."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.zoho.com for accounts outside the EU. With two-factor sign-in, "
"create an app-specific password."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan smtp.zoho.com untuk akun di luar EU. Dengan sign-in dua faktor, buat"
" kata sandi khusus aplikasi."

msgid "Username: API key. Password: secret key."
msgstr "Nama pengguna: kunci API. Kata sandi: kunci rahasia."

msgid ""
"Username and password: an SMTP user created under Sending → SMTP Users."
msgstr ""
"Nama pengguna dan kata sandi: pengguna SMTP yang dibuat di bawah Sending → "
"SMTP Users."

msgid "Username: the full mailbox address. Password: the mailbox password."
msgstr ""
"Nama pengguna: alamat kotak surat lengkap. Kata sandi: kata sandi kotak "
"surat."

msgid ""
"Use smtp.ionos.de or smtp.ionos.co.uk for those regions. Username: the full "
"mailbox address."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan smtp.ionos.de atau smtp.ionos.co.uk untuk wilayah tersebut. Nama "
"pengguna: alamat kotak surat lengkap."

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp"

msgid ""
"Sends all WordPress email through your own SMTP server, with a searchable "
"email log, resend, a backup connection, failure alerts and connection "
"diagnostics. No upsells."
msgstr ""
"Mengirim semua email WordPress melalui server SMTP Anda sendiri, dengan log "
"email yang dapat dicari, pengiriman ulang, koneksi cadangan, peringatan "
"kegagalan, dan diagnostik koneksi. Tanpa upsell."

msgid "lynbro aps"
msgstr "lynbro aps"

msgid "https://lynbro.dk"
msgstr "https://lynbro.dk"

msgid ""
"Host: the SMTP endpoint of your SES region, shown in the SES console under "
"SMTP settings. Username and password: SMTP credentials created in the SES "
"console (not your AWS access keys)."
msgstr ""
"Host: endpoint SMTP untuk wilayah SES Anda, ditampilkan di konsol SES di "
"bawah pengaturan SMTP. Username dan password: kredensial SMTP yang dibuat di"
" konsol SES (bukan access key AWS Anda)."

msgid "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "Lynbro SMTP Mailer"

msgid "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"
msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-smtp-mailer"

msgid "LynBro ApS"
msgstr "LynBro ApS"

msgid ""
"Optional. A Slack or Discord incoming webhook, or your own HTTPS endpoint "
"(JSON with \"text\" and \"content\"). The plugin posts the error text there "
"— nothing else, and only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Opsional. Webhook masuk Slack atau Discord, atau endpoint HTTPS Anda sendiri"
" (JSON dengan \"text\" dan \"content\"). Plugin mengirim teks error ke sana "
"— tidak ada yang lain, dan hanya saat Anda menetapkan URL."

msgid "Is %s doing its job?"
msgstr "Apakah %s bekerja dengan baik?"

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you, a short "
"review on WordPress.org helps other site owners find it — honest ones, "
"critical ones included."
msgstr ""
"Anda telah menggunakannya selama beberapa minggu. Jika bermanfaat, ulasan "
"singkat di WordPress.org akan membantu pemilik situs lain menemukannya — "
"baik ulasan jujur maupun kritis."

msgid ""
"You have used it for a couple of weeks now. If it works for you — or if "
"something is missing — tell us on our public roadmap. That is how we decide "
"what to build next."
msgstr ""
"Anda telah menggunakannya selama beberapa minggu. Jika bermanfaat — atau ada"
" yang kurang — beri tahu kami di roadmap publik kami. Itulah cara kami "
"menentukan fitur berikutnya."

msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(terbuka di tab baru)"

msgid "Share feedback"
msgstr "Bagikan masukan"

msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "Mungkin nanti"

msgid "Don't ask again"
msgstr "Jangan tanyakan lagi"

msgid "Something not working? Ask for help"
msgstr "Ada yang tidak berfungsi? Minta bantuan"

msgid "WooCommerce is active"
msgstr "WooCommerce aktif"

msgid "a form plugin is active"
msgstr "plugin formulir aktif"

msgid "the site is set up for Denmark"
msgstr "situs diatur untuk Denmark"

msgid "comments are open"
msgstr "komentar terbuka"

msgid "tracking tags are active"
msgstr "tag pelacakan aktif"

msgid "visitors can create accounts"
msgstr "pengunjung dapat membuat akun"

msgid "Suggested because %l."
msgstr "Disarankan karena %l."

msgid "Suggested for this site"
msgstr "Disarankan untuk situs ini"

msgid "Hide suggestions"
msgstr "Sembunyikan saran"

msgid ""
"Other Lynbro plugins that fit what this site uses. Nothing is installed "
"unless you click."
msgstr ""
"Plugin Lynbro lain yang sesuai dengan penggunaan situs ini. Tidak ada yang "
"terpasang kecuali Anda mengklik."

msgid "All Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Semua plugin Lynbro"

msgid ""
"Picked from what this site already uses — read on this site, nothing is sent"
" anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Dipilih dari apa yang sudah digunakan situs ini — dibaca di situs ini, tidak"
" ada data yang dikirim ke mana pun."

msgid "Image Optimizer"
msgstr "Pengoptimal Gambar"

msgid ""
"Convert to WebP and AVIF, right-size oversized images and lazy-load them — "
"all on your own server."
msgstr ""
"Konversi ke WebP dan AVIF, sesuaikan ukuran gambar yang terlalu besar, dan "
"aktifkan lazy-load — semuanya di server Anda sendiri."

msgid "AI Studio"
msgstr "Studio AI"

msgid ""
"Write and illustrate posts with AI on your own OpenAI key — at cost, with no"
" credits in between."
msgstr ""
"Tulis dan ilustrasikan postingan dengan AI menggunakan kunci OpenAI Anda "
"sendiri — tanpa biaya tambahan, tanpa sistem kredit."

msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analitik"

msgid ""
"Self-hosted, cookieless analytics with funnels. Visitor data never leaves "
"your database."
msgstr ""
"Analitik tanpa cookie yang dihosting sendiri dengan funnel. Data pengunjung "
"tidak pernah keluar dari database Anda."

msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Tag"

msgid ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel and more without code — each tag "
"waits for consent."
msgstr ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel dan lainnya tanpa kode — setiap tag"
" menunggu persetujuan."

msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Formulir"

msgid ""
"Forms with entries saved for free and no cap, conditional logic checked "
"server-side, and signed webhooks."
msgstr ""
"Formulir dengan entri tersimpan gratis tanpa batas, logika kondisional dicek"
" di server, dan webhook yang ditandatangani."

msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verifikasi"

msgid ""
"Catch mistyped e-mail domains and bad phone numbers, and confirm them with a"
" one-time code by e-mail or SMS."
msgstr ""
"Tangkap domain e-mail salah ketik dan nomor telepon tidak valid, serta "
"konfirmasi dengan kode sekali pakai via e-mail atau SMS."

msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Cache"

msgid ""
"Reliable purging for an nginx FastCGI cache and a Redis object cache, with "
"every purge verified against the cache itself."
msgstr ""
"Pembersihan andal untuk cache nginx FastCGI dan cache objek Redis, dengan "
"setiap pembersihan diverifikasi langsung ke cache."

msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Terjemahkan"

msgid ""
"Run your site in several languages, with machine translation on your own "
"OpenAI key — nothing metered, nothing sold by the word."
msgstr ""
"Jalankan situs Anda dalam beberapa bahasa, dengan terjemahan mesin "
"menggunakan kunci OpenAI Anda sendiri — tanpa biaya per kata."

msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Perisai"

msgid ""
"Security headers, HTTPS with HSTS, a small firewall against injection probes"
" and the hardening switches every site needs."
msgstr ""
"Header keamanan, HTTPS dengan HSTS, firewall kecil untuk mencegah injeksi, "
"dan penguatan yang dibutuhkan setiap situs."

msgid "Anti-Spam"
msgstr "Anti-Spam"

msgid ""
"Spam checks that run on your own server. No account, no subscription, every "
"block says why — and a held message is never lost."
msgstr ""
"Pemeriksaan spam dijalankan di server Anda sendiri. Tanpa akun, tanpa "
"langganan, setiap blokir dijelaskan — dan pesan yang ditahan tidak pernah "
"hilang."

msgid "Login Guard"
msgstr "Login Guard"

msgid ""
"Move wp-login.php, limit failed sign-ins and add app-based two-factor — with"
" three ways back in."
msgstr ""
"Pindahkan wp-login.php, batasi percobaan login gagal, dan tambahkan "
"autentikasi dua faktor berbasis aplikasi — dengan tiga cara pemulihan."

msgid "Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Persetujuan Cookie"

msgid ""
"A GDPR and ePrivacy banner with Consent Mode v2, an equally prominent Reject"
" button and 35 languages."
msgstr ""
"Banner GDPR dan ePrivacy dengan Consent Mode v2, tombol Tolak yang sama "
"mencolok, dan 35 bahasa."

msgid "Activity Log"
msgstr "Log Aktivitas"

msgid ""
"Who did what, when and from where — written down on your own server, "
"searchable, exportable, and deleted on your schedule."
msgstr ""
"Siapa melakukan apa, kapan, dan dari mana — dicatat di server Anda sendiri, "
"bisa dicari, diekspor, dan dihapus sesuai jadwal Anda."

msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Retensi Data"

msgid ""
"Find where personal data actually sits in your database, then delete it on a"
" schedule — with a dry run before every deletion."
msgstr ""
"Temukan lokasi data pribadi di database Anda, lalu hapus sesuai jadwal — "
"dengan simulasi sebelum setiap penghapusan."

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Aksesibilitas"

msgid ""
"Scan every page against WCAG 2.2 AA and fix what can be fixed safely. No "
"overlay, no page limit."
msgstr ""
"Pindai setiap halaman sesuai WCAG 2.2 AA dan perbaiki yang bisa diperbaiki "
"dengan aman. Tanpa overlay, tanpa batas halaman."

msgid "SEO"
msgstr "SEO"

msgid ""
"Lean SEO with free LocalBusiness schema, sitemaps and social cards. Nothing "
"phones home."
msgstr ""
"SEO ringan dengan schema LocalBusiness gratis, sitemap, dan kartu sosial. "
"Tidak ada data yang dikirim keluar."

msgid "SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "SMTP Mailer"

msgid ""
"WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log, resend, a "
"backup connection and failure alerts."
msgstr ""
"Email WordPress melalui server SMTP Anda sendiri — dengan log email, kirim "
"ulang, koneksi cadangan, dan notifikasi kegagalan."

msgid "Social Feed"
msgstr "Feed Sosial"

msgid ""
"An Instagram feed on your site without a Meta token stored in WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Feed Instagram di situs Anda tanpa token Meta yang disimpan di WordPress."

msgid "Reviews Cache"
msgstr "Cache Ulasan"

msgid "Show your Google reviews without putting an API key in WordPress."
msgstr "Tampilkan ulasan Google Anda tanpa memasukkan API key di WordPress."

msgid "Links"
msgstr "Tautan"

msgid ""
"Find broken links and manage redirects on your own server, with the reason "
"for every verdict."
msgstr ""
"Temukan tautan rusak dan kelola redirect di server Anda sendiri, dengan "
"alasan untuk setiap keputusan."

msgid "Danadresse Autofill"
msgstr "Danadresse Isi Otomatis"

msgid ""
"Danish address autocomplete and validation for WooCommerce, WPForms, "
"Gravity, Fluent, Formidable and EDD."
msgstr ""
"Otomatis isi dan validasi alamat Denmark untuk WooCommerce, WPForms, "
"Gravity, Fluent, Formidable, dan EDD."

msgid "Soge Lookup"
msgstr "Soge Lookup"

msgid ""
"Look up Danish vehicles (DMR) and companies (CVR) by plate, VIN or CVR "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Cari kendaraan (DMR) dan perusahaan (CVR) Denmark berdasarkan plat, VIN, "
"atau nomor CVR."

msgid "CVR Checkout"
msgstr "CVR Checkout"

msgid ""
"Danish B2B checkout for WooCommerce: CVR company autofill, CVR/EU-VAT (VIES)"
" validation and an EAN/GLN field."
msgstr ""
"Checkout B2B Denmark untuk WooCommerce: isi otomatis perusahaan CVR, "
"validasi CVR/EU-VAT (VIES), dan kolom EAN/GLN."

msgid "Danish Shipping"
msgstr "Pengiriman Denmark"

msgid ""
"Free pickup point selection for PostNord and GLS Denmark at the WooCommerce "
"checkout, plus clean shipping methods."
msgstr ""
"Pilihan titik pengambilan gratis untuk PostNord dan GLS Denmark di checkout "
"WooCommerce, serta metode pengiriman yang bersih."

msgid "API Auth"
msgstr "API Auth"

msgid ""
"JSON Web Tokens for the REST API that you can actually revoke, with scopes "
"and a journal of refusals."
msgstr ""
"JSON Web Token untuk REST API yang dapat dicabut, dengan scope dan jurnal "
"penolakan."

msgid "Failure alerts by email do not get out"
msgstr "Peringatan kegagalan melalui email tidak terkirim"

msgid ""
"The alert email is sent with PHP mail() so that it does not depend on the "
"SMTP server, but PHP mail() failed on this server: %s Use a webhook for "
"alerts, or ask your host to enable mail()."
msgstr ""
"Email peringatan dikirim dengan PHP mail() sehingga tidak bergantung pada "
"server SMTP, tetapi PHP mail() gagal di server ini: %s Gunakan webhook untuk"
" peringatan, atau minta penyedia hosting Anda mengaktifkan mail()."

msgid ""
"This is the previous version of Lynbro SMTP. Lynbro SMTP Mailer has replaced"
" it and uses the same settings. Remove the folder %s with your host's file "
"manager, FTP or SSH — do not use Delete here: its uninstall erases the "
"shared SMTP settings. Lynbro SMTP Mailer keeps a backup and puts them back, "
"but the old plugin also empties the email log."
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah versi sebelumnya dari Lynbro SMTP. Lynbro SMTP Mailer telah "
"menggantikannya dan menggunakan pengaturan yang sama. Hapus folder %s "
"menggunakan pengelola file hosting, FTP, atau SSH—jangan gunakan Hapus di "
"sini: proses pencopotannya akan menghapus pengaturan SMTP bersama. Lynbro "
"SMTP Mailer menyimpan cadangan dan memulihkannya, tetapi plugin lama juga "
"mengosongkan log email."

msgid ""
"Your SMTP settings were deleted by another plugin on %s and have been "
"restored from the backup. Nothing for you to do; send a test email if you "
"want to be sure."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan SMTP Anda dihapus oleh plugin lain pada %s dan telah dipulihkan "
"dari cadangan. Anda tidak perlu melakukan apa pun; kirim email uji jika "
"ingin memastikannya."

msgid ""
"This site sends with the server's own mail (PHP mail()). The test shows "
"whether the server accepted the email; check its headers in the inbox "
"(Authentication-Results: spf=pass, dmarc=pass)."
msgstr ""
"Situs ini mengirim email menggunakan layanan email bawaan server (PHP "
"mail()). Pengujian ini menunjukkan apakah server menerima email tersebut; "
"periksa header-nya di kotak masuk (Authentication-Results: spf=pass, "
"dmarc=pass)."

msgid ""
"Make sure it includes this web server (its IP address with ip4: or ip6:, or "
"a: / mx: that resolves to it)."
msgstr ""
"Pastikan entri tersebut mencakup server web ini (alamat IP-nya dengan ip4: "
"atau ip6:, atau a: / mx: yang mengarah ke server ini)."

msgid ""
"Email is sent with this server's own mail (PHP mail()), from %s, with a "
"matching Return-Path."
msgstr ""
"Email dikirim menggunakan layanan email bawaan server ini (PHP mail()), dari"
" %s, dengan Return-Path yang cocok."

msgid ""
"Return-Path is off: the server puts its own address on the envelope, so SPF "
"checks that domain instead of yours."
msgstr ""
"Return-Path nonaktif: server menggunakan alamatnya sendiri pada amplop "
"email, sehingga SPF memeriksa domain tersebut, bukan domain Anda."

msgid "Email is sent with the server's own mail, with a matching sender"
msgstr ""
"Email dikirim menggunakan layanan email bawaan server, dengan alamat "
"pengirim yang cocok"

msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends with PHP mail() by your choice and sets the From address "
"and Return-Path on every email. Keep this server in the domain's SPF record."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP mengirim email menggunakan PHP mail() sesuai pilihan Anda, serta"
" menetapkan alamat From dan Return-Path pada setiap email. Sertakan server "
"ini dalam catatan SPF domain."

msgid "This server's own mail (PHP mail(), no SMTP)"
msgstr "Layanan email bawaan server ini (PHP mail(), tanpa SMTP)"

msgid ""
"For servers that are set up to send mail themselves. No login needed: the "
"From address and the Return-Path below are still set on every email, so SPF "
"and DMARC can line up. The domain's SPF record must include this server."
msgstr ""
"Untuk server yang dikonfigurasi agar mengirim email sendiri. Tidak perlu "
"login: alamat From dan Return-Path di bawah ini tetap ditetapkan pada setiap"
" email, sehingga SPF dan DMARC dapat selaras. Catatan SPF domain harus "
"mencakup server ini."
